                "message": "Name the notes, bibliography and checkout locations once in sp-paths\n\nAbout thirty modules spelled out ~/notes, ~/bibliography, ~/Documents and the\nlike. They now read sp-notes-dir, sp-bibliography-dir and friends from the new\nsp-paths module, which can be overridden from the environment (SP_NOTES_DIR\netc.). The machine-specific org-agenda-files list is dropped from the Custom\nblock of init.el.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015QV8A7ivyRigBtBymbF9FR",
