                },
                "message": "Move env/ modules to base/, require sp-paths in sp-env, drop the Custom block\n\nThe five env/ modules and their docs move into base/, with docs/main.org and\nthe tangle paths updated. sp-env requires sp-paths and explains how the SP_*\noverrides relate to the shell import. The custom-set-variables and\ncustom-set-faces block at the end of init.el is removed so vulpea-para decides\nwhich agenda files load.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015QV8A7ivyRigBtBymbF9FR",
                "tree": {
